# Build context filter for the multilanguage gRPC server images
# (python/Dockerfile.grpc{,.async}, c/Dockerfile.grpc).
#
# Those builds use the repo root as their context so they can COPY from
# rust/target/, python/, c/ and rust/multilanguage-test-server/. Without this file the
# context is the whole working tree — including a multi-gigabyte rust/target/
# directory and the kafka/ Java source submodule — which docker uploads to
# the daemon on every build.
#
# Only the handful of paths the Dockerfiles actually COPY are re-included.

# Everything cargo produces, except the three artifacts the images need.
rust/target
!rust/target/release/libconfluent_kafka.a
!rust/target/release/libconfluent_kafka.so
!rust/target/include/confluent_kafka.h

# Java source reference (~270 MB) and git history (~330 MB).
kafka
.git

# Local build/venv trees, none of which are copied into any image.
venv
c/build
python/build
python/*.egg-info
python/**/__pycache__
rust/consumer-perf/target
rust/coverage
